# Signing material must never enter this repo, even by accident. Tundra's update chain
# (PHASE2.md P2-D16) is a single CA with an offline root: the release key that signs every
# image, and the abuild key that signs the package repository. A leak of either is
# unrecoverable — every installed machine trusts them, and P2-R09 records that RAUC has no
# rotation mechanism to fall back on.
#
# This is the mechanical backstop for a stray `git add -A`. Staging explicitly is still the
# rule, and this list is not a substitute for it.
*.pem
*.key
*.rsa
*.priv
*.p12
*.pfx
*.cer
*.crt
*.gpg
*.asc
.env
.env.*

# Build and image output, should any land here by mistake. This repo holds documents;
# artifacts belong in tundra-pilot or a Phase 2 build repo.
*.img
*.iso
*.raucb
*.apk

# OS and editor cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~
